# Credentials for ax25netd.
#
# This file must be readable only by root and the account ax25netd runs
# under; keep it mode 0600.  The "installconf" target installs a copy
# with mode 0600 and never overwrites an existing file.
#
# Format:  <target>  <user>  <password>
#
# Target "ax25netd": client authentication of this instance (requires
#   "auth required" in agwpe.conf).  Every AGWPE client connecting to
#   the loop port must log in with one of these credentials.
#
# Any other target: optional login sent to the upstream of that name
#   after connecting (AGWPE on Windows, a second ax25netd in a chain).
#   Servers such as Direwolf need no entry and receive no credentials.

# ax25netd	dl9sau		geheim
